# Professor Rowan: the theme of his scenes (the original's SEQ_OPENING role in the field), as he strides onto Route 201
# to stop two children at the tall grass, and later as he speaks of the Pokédex. A stately, measured march in B-flat:
# the horn's stern dotted tune over low brass, tuba, timpani and a soft snare, answered by a warm, singing line in the
# strings that turns for a moment to the minor iv before the march comes back. Original composition for this game.
title Professor Rowan
tempo 96
meter 4/4
reverb 0.26

